flowchart TB
    request[Parent requests bounded assignment]
    capacity{Policy and capacity valid?}
    durable[Durable assignment\nrequested / spawn_pending]
    create[Core creates disposable session]
    running[Worker runs with only\nteam_report_ephemeral_result]
    result{Result report}
    completed[Completed result\nsummary, artifacts, optional exact branch]
    failed[Failed result\ndurable error evidence]

    subgraph decision[Parent decision lane]
        inspect[Parent inspects completed evidence]
        choice{Accept?}
        accepted[Accepted]
        rejected[Rejected with reason]
        deliverable[Deliverable attributed to parent\nnormal review still required]
    end

    subgraph cleanup[Independent cleanup lane]
        route[Route completed core session]
        destroy[Destroy disposable session]
        cleaned[Cleanup recorded]
        cleanupFailed[Cleanup failure retained]
    end

    request --> capacity
    capacity -- no --> deny[Reject without partial batch]
    capacity -- yes --> durable --> create --> running --> result
    result -- success --> completed
    result -- error --> failed

    completed --> inspect --> choice
    choice -- yes --> accepted --> deliverable
    choice -- no --> rejected

    completed --> route
    failed --> route
    route --> destroy
    destroy -- success --> cleaned
    destroy -- failure --> cleanupFailed
    cleaned -. parent may decide before or after cleanup .-> inspect

    invariant[Cleanup and parent decision are independent milestones.\nDestroying the session never deletes assignment evidence.]
    invariant --- decision
    invariant --- cleanup
